WEBVTT

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.350
I've never done it before, but I'll do it now.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.180
I've got to be kidding...

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:22.990
Shyness and bewilderment, should I add up those experiences?

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:25.030
Even if I've seen some things, I'll turn a blind eye to them.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:27.750
They disappear with a flicker.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.840
I imagine the afterimage with an intense movie.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:38.160
I unintentionally blurt out, "I kind of like you."

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:41.490
I have a temperature and a cold coming on.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.940
It's no-no-normal.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.690
When the contradictions come to an end, a white horse appears.

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.440
How strange! How strange!

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:54.780
You look like the prince!

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:57.530
The regret from the kiss won't disappear.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:01.540
Why did you give it to me even though it's just puppy love?

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:05.190
We should start over at the least.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:08.210
It's not over. The kiss was passionate.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.270
It was just too sudden, so what should we do?

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.830
Quickly, the horse from before!

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.930
Should we ride away? Just the two of us? And then leave it?

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:21.560
No, no, no.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:25.620
What I really want is for us to make

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.810
a secret plan!

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.720
What's wrong, young lady?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:06.740
Could it be that I am too charming? Your immature body and mind want to offer themselves to me.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:10.040
That's bothering me! In 10 years...

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:14.690
In 10 years I'll pick the lush fruit that is suddenly-

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.280
Idiot! Look at that.

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:31.250
You're a steel can, right?

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.150
Why do you know that I'm a steel can?

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:42.120
Some old guy with glasses told me that ones with an earring on the left ear are steel cans.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.300
Glasses?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:48.560
We want you to fight to decide it. The last can will be the one we officially recognize.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.420
Hey, hey, young lady.

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.880
Could it be that you want to participate in that so-called Akikan Elect?

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.180
Right!

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.030
"Right"...

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.450
You! Introduce yourself!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:06.460
The television mentioned that it is proper etiquette to introduce yourself first in this situation.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:09.290
Okay. Then I'll tell you.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:13.850
I'm called Budoko. Misaki gave me the name.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:13.850
Note: Budo (grape) + ko (child) = Budoko

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:17.530
Even if I tell you my name, I won't tell you what kind of can I am.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.510
If I told you, it would be bad for me.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:24.800
I see. You're the grape juice Akikan, right?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:29.050
How did you know?

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:34.350
My plan of hiding information to confuse the foe has failed.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.560
If you've prepared yourself...

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:45.170
Hey! Hey! Both of you calm down.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:51.040
Hey Melon-kun, why are you getting worked up? I said that we wouldn't participate in the Akikan Elect.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:56.440
A fight?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.460
A dispute over a love triangle?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.500
Isn't that Daichi from Class C?

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.800
That man is a two-timer. Even with such a young kid...

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:04.970
Pedophile...

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:05.960
Abnormal...

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.850
I'm jealous-

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.950
No, scum of society.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.730
Anyway, let's discuss this elsewhere.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:17.550
Right. Misaki said that I shouldn't trouble other people.

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:27.470
Hey, what is it?

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:28.650
Hurry and go.

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.560
You guys lead.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:33.550
Hold on. Are you planning a sneak attack from behind?

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.420
I'm not!

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:41.300
This is my first time coming here. You need to lead me!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:44.050
Don't wander around if you don't know the way!

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.460
Kakeru, stay over there. I'll finish this right away.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.060
Wait. Why are you suddenly motivated?

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.440
Grape Bullet!

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.270
That's your attack?

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.140
Right.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.500
Are you an idiot?

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:23.150
This is an attack which causes damage to your spirit.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.650
How can that cause any damage?

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.410
Grape Strike!

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:40.690
Misaki said that you can't just steal other's things.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.280
Their mental age is the same.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.740
The game stops here.

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.220
Grape Shoot!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:00.580
You evaded it well. If you get hit by this, it will be difficult to wash off.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.930
Ahh! Misaki will be angry with me!

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:10.590
That's enough. Just surrender and go home. You can't beat me.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.640
We just started! Shut up and watch!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:21.170
W-What? I don't see anything besides your refilling your juice.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:21.960
Right.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:23.270
That's cunning!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.570
Grape Shot!

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:31.660
This bullet is bigger. Will it also go father?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.870
Eat this! Sour Grape!

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:39.080
Yeah yeah.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.630
How was that?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.760
Hey, hey! This isn't a joke.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.520
I've got you cornered.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:03.770
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.690
What...

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.660
Melo-Melo-

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.780
Stop it!

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.350
What are you doing?!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:28.610
Hey! Hey!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.090
Why are you being so serious on a kid?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.680
It can't be helped, right? This is a battle.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:37.810
And that's why I said not to fight!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:42.010
Why do you believe what that suspicious bureaucrat said?

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.140
Just like an idiot.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.900
Just like an idiot?

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.510
Today I will retreat.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:52.740
The next time we meet will be the date of your death.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.670
It appears that there was not a decisive victory.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:04.900
Though it was insufficient, we saw an interesting expression. Isn't that enough, Airin-kun?

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:08.570
It's Kizaki. Please don't ask me for a similar opinion.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.950
If I call you Kizaki, will you help apply my sunscreen?

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:16.080
W-What's the relationship between those? I refuse.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:26.270
In short, a little girl needs to be protected,

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.750
and not fought against.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:36.600
After some time, she'll become slim and graceful, and the day she pleases me will come.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.660
This is the so-called happiness.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.490
What is happiness?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.190
What is happiness for us cans?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:49.040
Where did that come from? It's the same as us.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.050
Just like an idiot!

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.220
You don't understand our feelings!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.390
Hey, wait! Where are you going?

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:07.070
What's with you? You're the one who doesn't understand my feelings.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.980
Ouch!

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.430
Welcome.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:32.150
You're pretty cute. How old are you?

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:35.630
How about a cold fruit juice or hot coffee?

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:40.380
Hey, hey! Are you inviting me for tea? That's dangerous.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.480
Please press any of the buttons.

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.620
You're quite provocative.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.790
I'd rather not have your older brother appear the moment I touch you.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.780
Please press any of the buttons.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:57.410
What a pain. Unfortunately I've had bad luck with love recently. My spirits haven't been uplifted.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.520
Please press any of the buttons.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:03.870
Well, don't rush me. There is an order for every-

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.580
*stare*

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:09.290
W-What is it! What are you doing, Najimi?

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:14.750
I'm buying things for dinner. Kakeru-chan, you still haven't gone home?

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:18.280
It's better to talk to the vending machine in front of your own house.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.050
Leave me alone.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.860
This is my hobby.

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:21.720
Hobby?

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:28.690
Face-to-face communication. E-mail and mobile phones have gradually estranged relations.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:32.940
Even if it's a vending machine, I must communicate well. Such is my disposition.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.400
Kakeru-chan is great!

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.530
Right. Right.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.830
*push*

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:41.280
Thank you very much.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.380
Then, that's how it is.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.680
If you're going home, let's walk back together.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:49.620
Going home?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.040
Aren't you going home?

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.960
Najimi, can I stay at your place tonight?

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:03.100
No! No! That's not it! I don't mean anything weird.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:08.000
Y-Yeah, let's have a study session. Midterms are approaching.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.940
Call everyone and have a study session at your house.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:20.830
Kakeru-chan, come in, come in... Although it's a little messy...

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.410
Not a little...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.670
Sit on that side.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:28.060
That side... Which side do you mean?

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.190
I'll make some black tea.

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.790
Listen to me.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:42.550
Pitiful and lamentable!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:47.560
Even if it's temporary, this is a high school girl's room, the place that a man is always dreaming about.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.160
I could eat three bowls of rice thinking about it!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:54.060
It's the friend of the night that no one can bear!

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.040
Okay, the black tea is done.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.640
You should consider throwing away unnecessary things.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:04.530
If I don't treasure used things, the ghost of waste will appear.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.000
That again?

00:12:06.650 --> 00:12:09.660
This was also made with used tea leaves that have been dried.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.850
You'll attract the ghost of waste!

00:12:12.850 --> 00:12:14.730
What did you make me drink?

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.980
Kakeru-chan, take off it quickly. It will stain.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.130
H-Hey!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:24.530
Take it off in the bathroom. I'll wash it.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.930
Then I'll borrow your bathroom for a while.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.410
I've been running places today so I'm sweaty.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.870
That's right. It must have been troublesome.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.440
It was Melon-chan's first day going to school.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.610
What's wrong, Kakeru-chan?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:46.590
Invading a pretty high school girl's bathroom...

00:12:46.590 --> 00:12:49.530
Stop speaking like that.

00:12:56.990 --> 00:13:00.320
Kakeru-chan, I'm leaving the towel here.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.090
Ah! Thank you.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.280
Najimi? What's wrong? Is there anything else?

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.950
Kakeru-chan, turn that way a bit.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.270
Why?

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.810
Just do it. Turn that way and sit down.

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.150
What's she thinking?

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.340
Kakeru-chan, have you turned around?

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.280
Yeah. What are you-

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.360
W-Why did you come inside?

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:37.490
I wanted to help scrub your back.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.940
I-It's fine! I can do that myself.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:43.690
But haven't we scrubbed each other's backs before?

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:47.790
That was when we were elementary students! Now it's completely different!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:50.390
Well... in various ways.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:52.870
That's good...

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.680
Kakeru-chan has feelings for Najimi...

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:59.770
No, it's nothing. I'll help scrub your back.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.340
How cheap are you?

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:08.030
Because you know, if I don't it all the ghost of waste will appear.

00:14:08.550 --> 00:14:10.830
The ghost of waste in your mind,

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.780
has eyes as sharp as an exam proctor.

00:14:13.780 --> 00:14:18.000
You're noisy. I'm helping you, so don't complain.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.540
Hey, Kakeru-chan.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.340
Did something happen to you?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:30.400
Najimi who grew up with you knows.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.340
When I met you in front of the vending machine, you were acting strangely.

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.620
Najimi wants to help you.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:45.770
I want to repay my debt for rescuing Najimi two years ago.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:51.490
I don't want to be a girl whom you have to protect anymore.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:55.780
What are you talking about? Haven't you already saved me several times?

00:14:57.430 --> 00:15:01.640
Two years ago after that incident, everyone was scared of me.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.460
To me who had lost my home,

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:05.650
weren't you supportive the whole time?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:09.830
You gave me a place to be.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.740
So I'm really grateful.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.180
Kakeru-chan...

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:18.470
Well, if you really want to comfort a boy of my age,

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:21.810
it would be better if you offered your body.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.370
All right.

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.740
If it's Kakeru-chan, Najimi is fine.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:40.070
S-S-Sorry.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:47.110
A-All that's left is for you to rinse yourself.

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:49.140
You can do that yourself.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.280
You're so cute today, Najimi.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.680
It tickles!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.640
Isn't it good? Isn't it good?

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.400
Really...

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.630
Daichi.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.690
Why do you have such a refreshed face after taking a bath?

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.700
Najimi is a little wet. Could it be that...

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.160
you raped her?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.660
What the heck?

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:22.330
Is that true?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:27.630
Good. I'm going to inspect if my Najimi has protected her chastity well.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.920
No, stop it, Yuriri.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.360
I'll really get angry.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.410
You two! That sort of...

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:40.560
It's strange for girls to be doing this kind of thing.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.700
I won't allow it.

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:45.450
What? You were here, Gigolo?

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:57.700
Kakeru-chan, is it okay that we're not studying during the study session?

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.180
Oh right! Study session!

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:04.710
Why is it that you're the least motivated?

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:08.570
Shut up! Can't I call you guys without being motivated?

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:12.330
I may not be motivated, but the call girls will come out one by one.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.940
Kakeru!

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.460
Although I haven't called them.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:18.930
Don't joke in front of Najimi!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.450
Don't make me laugh.

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:25.180
I can't imagine ever being treated by you over the phone to "take out"-

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.440
Do you want to pace in the six realms?

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:32.770
If I am, confine me to a pink Shangri-La.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:36.380
Wait, wait, wait! Both of you calm down.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:37.650
Oh yeah!

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:42.680
Let's have some snacks. Since Gigolo also brought juice...

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:43.330
Okay?

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.770
If Najimi says so,

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.070
I will spare the life of this trash.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.500
Here, Kakeru-chan.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.400
Ah, thank you.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:00.600
It's okay.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:04.500
You're not drinking it? Kakeru-chan likes juice, right?

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.000
Now is a little...

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.720
What a waste...

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.690
Then you drink it.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.650
Hey, Najimi! Is that carbonated?

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.700
You drank something carbonated.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:25.330
Eh? I didn't drink it. What are you talking about?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.290
Ow, ow, ow! What? What is it?

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.230
Najimi, give that to me.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.170
No way~

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.960
Daichi, what's the matter with her?

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:42.050
Najimi gets drunk as soon as she drinks anything carbonated.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:46.650
Najimi thinks...

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.720
that she has a good idea!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:50.480
Stop.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:55.690
Kakeru is a pervert. He wants to take off Najimi's clothes.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.360
I don't know what you mean. Hey, come on. Let go of me.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.630
Hey, Kakeru-chan...

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:07.210
Do you... love Najimi?

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.370
Wha... What are you talking about?

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.460
Do you hate me?

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:14.980
I-I don't hate you.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.810
Then kiss Najimi.

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:27.260
You, Kochikaze! You kicked me!

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:31.940
I can't let my loved one get drunk alone.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.230
I have prepared myself.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.840
What's that?

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.940
My specially concocted magic medicine.

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:49.200
Come, Najimi. Now you are no longer alone.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.560
Now, kiss with me and not Daichi.

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:53.920
I don't wanna!

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:59.420
Najimi! Aren't we lovers?

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:05.320
Although I like you, it's not that kind of like.

00:20:05.320 --> 00:20:06.720
How come?

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.100
The thing I bought in the afternoon.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.570
Of all things... why did I buy this?

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.460
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:38.130
Hey, hey, you. Would you like to accompany me for a while?

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.420
This feeling...

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:48.930
Juice, juice! Which one?

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.290
Which one to choose?

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:55.930
Then... this!

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:21.080
It is a pleasure to meet you, Owner.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:25.010
I am a sports drink aluminum can. My name is Yell.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:30.260
For passing life into me through your lips, I sincerely thank you.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:39.070
Najimi's first kiss!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:02.580
The days passed with a dry mood

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.540
There remains a sweet aftertaste

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:06.510
It's like this ache is paralyzing me

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:08.460
The distant memories are suddenly awakened

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.370
The faint fluttering of my heart

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.350
Adds up after that first kiss

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.010
Is it all right to be immersed in it all

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.300
Because I cannot meet with you

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:20.300
Encounter him, care a bit about him

00:22:20.420 --> 00:22:24.180
Eyes end with eyes, it's a miracle!

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:27.890
Everyone everyone everyone around and around

00:22:28.050 --> 00:22:32.060
Don't stop the cycle of love!

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:38.190
Everyday is jolting with excitement

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.200
I want you to fill it

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:43.870
With lots of love

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.790
Don't be empty, Darling

00:22:47.920 --> 00:22:50.930
Delivering the two's

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:55.100
overflowing cheers of love

00:22:55.180 --> 00:22:56.130
Come on (kiss)

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:57.210
More (kiss)

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:59.020
Forever (kiss kiss)

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.900
When I'm alone, I want to see you, but there's no choice because I love you

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:06.730
When your heart is dry

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.440
We can meet any time

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:15.060
Would you like something to drink?

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.060
This is annoying!

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:21.790
Next time I must defeat all the steel cans!

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:24.330
Another aluminum can is showing up?

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:28.130
Then what about my turn?
